// ============================================================
// FILE: TraderMenu.layout  (trader BUY/SELL window, v2 - vanilla look)
//
// v2 fixed the layout defects found by the geometry audit:
//   * Background used size 1300 990 together with hexactsize 0, i.e. a FRACTION
//     of the parent - the panel ended up 1 690 000 px wide. Now size 1 1.
//   * the money value started at x 1110 with a width of 300 inside a 1300 px
//     window, so 110 px of it were off-screen. The money block is right-aligned
//     inside the window now.
//   * the item preview was 470x257 px, so the wheel-zoom guard in TraderMenu.c
//     (if (w > 0.5 && w < 3)) could never match. It is a fraction-sized widget
//     inside a square panel now, exactly like the vanilla inspect window.
//   * all widgets declare exp/eyp/exs/eys explicitly, so no value is left to
//     the layout engine default.
//
// Styles are the vanilla ones from gui/looknfeel/dayzwidgets.styles:
//   DayZDefaultPanel / DayZDefaultPanelTop / rover_sim_black /
//   rover_sim_blackbox / ColorablePanel, buttons MenuDefault, listbox
//   Default, combobox Default, checkbox Default, slider Default, editbox Default.
// scaled 1 - the whole window scales with the resolution, as vanilla menus do.
//
// Icons: icon_plus (buy), iconArrowUp (sell), circle (quality), right_mouse
// (right-click hint). The search icon is the mod's own magnifier texture
// TRADER_NPC/images/search.edds.
//
// New widgets for the functionality added in the same pass:
//   text_discount      - current survival rating discount
//   ItemQuality        - condition in words
//   SellBonusWidget    - price breakdown (condition + accessories + rounds)
//   SellAmountText     - sell X of Y
//   SellQuantitySlider - amount slider, for selling part of a stack
//   SellHint / SellHintIcon - right mouse button = sell
//
// Fonts follow the vanilla distribution: Light24 @18 for the list and the
// details, Book24 @20/22/24/28 for buttons, money and the title.
// ============================================================
FrameWidgetClass TraderMenu {
 visible 0
 color 0 0 0 0
 position 0 0
 size 1300 990
 halign center_ref
 valign center_ref
 hexactpos 1
 vexactpos 1
 hexactsize 1
 vexactsize 1
 scaled 1
 {
  PanelWidgetClass Background {
   visible 1
   color 0 0 0 0.85
   position 0 0
   size 1 1
   halign left_ref
   valign top_ref
   hexactpos 0
   vexactpos 0
   hexactsize 0
   vexactsize 0
   priority 0
   style DayZDefaultPanel
  }
